    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18827" root="سبل" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسْبَلُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  A man <i>long in the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبَلَة</span> [q. v., here
said in the TA to mean the <i>beard,</i> but this is
questionable], as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبَلَانِىٌّ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْبِلٌ</span></b>  and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْبَلٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَبِّلٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسَبَّلٌ</span></b> . (M, K, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
And the fem., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَبْلَآءُ</span>, (assumed tropical:)  A woman <i>having hair in
the place of the mustache.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And (assumed tropical:)  An
eye <i>having long lashes.</i> (M, K.)

